    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Industry Relationships</strong><br>
      Foster stronger links with game industry professionals.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Annual Conference</strong><br>
      Establish a yearly game design conference like Vector.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>



